  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is an equilateral triangle with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> such that its orthocentre lies on a circle with centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
